# "Right." is a flash, so it joins the next Sentence even though the pair is over the
# character limit; halving re-cuts the pair, and the first Cue still spans the sentence
# end because the only Sentence end is not a balanced place to cut.
S 0.0 0.3
W 0.0 0.3 Right.
S 0.5 5.3
W 0.50 0.80 The
W 0.80 1.10 engine
W 1.10 1.40 is
W 1.40 1.70 running,
W 1.70 2.00 the
W 2.00 2.30 brakes
W 2.30 2.60 are
W 2.60 2.90 checked,
W 2.90 3.20 and
W 3.20 3.50 the
W 3.50 3.80 tires
W 3.80 4.10 have
W 4.10 4.40 enough
W 4.40 4.70 air
W 4.70 5.00 in
W 5.00 5.30 them
